GTnXIyt1Og9THXv0iaAywrUk/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2UzEdHTepvDumlX9dNBsUO7c8SDl0HekfJHw4Ik9ODX5npUgHPItIAycTKaSqc5R5hQviaiaM6PKV5KiaZ9jOX2wps42qttojpwXXPeJ2icBWmU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>组织管理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>学院成立由主要党政领导及相关人员组成的</span><strong><span><span>招收推免生工作领导小组</span></span></strong><span>，全面负责本单位推免生招收工作，并成立相关工作组负责具体接收、材料审核、设备及后勤保障、日常咨询及招生宣传工作。</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/ibbDic3EUwGI2y4k27uTicS0ibFsiaDf9fXtd46yLZTjKVxKTPdk7D0C9vysV65ePk9omMw9qZ11HOxQ5NgNeYCLpbw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>招收条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1.</span></span></strong><span>中华人民共和国公民，拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法，身体健康状况符合国家和学校规定的体检要求；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.</span></span></strong><span>获得目前就读学校推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生，其他符合免初试攻读硕士研究生资格条件的人员；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>3.</span></span></strong><span>科学研究兴趣浓厚，具有较好的</span><strong><span><span>科研潜质、专业能力、实践能力</span></span></strong><span>和较强的</span><strong><span><span>创新意识、创业潜力</span></span></strong><span>；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>4.</span></span></strong><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何违法违纪受处分记录；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>5.</span></span></strong><span>学院规定的其他条件。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/enUf10XOwjElFTVf3n2XJSPhPo8YcVYF7RjSOxcNSOibiawv5VatMrV8IQYMQLic70FzBQCoKIAowJtVFqlOiapQmg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/aJHjyhnezbKRNicOse5WiaY9ybBkueAeatWbsiaBFhEfWu4VNm0bDJnaMu465NTnTcfNF68jS7zdpdKm2IaMhIMOg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>招收流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>申请报名包括</span></span></strong><span>学校推免服务系统报名和全国推免管理服务系统报名确认</span><strong><span><span>两个阶段</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>学校推免服务系统报名 </span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.1</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span>可取得推免资格的校内外推免生，均须参加学校推免服务系统报名。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>1.</span></span></strong><span>申请人于9月6日-14日期间，登录学校推免报名系统：http://yzbm.xjtu.edu.cn，完整填写报名信息，并在附件中提交以下材料的电子扫描件：</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（1）</span></span></strong><span><span>学生证及身份证复印件1份；</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>（2）</span></span></strong><span>本科阶段成绩单、综合成绩排名证明（均须加盖学校或学院教务部门公章）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（3）</span></span></strong><span>英语水平证明材料1份（英语四/六级考试成绩、TOEFL成绩、GRE/GMAT成绩等）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（4）</span></span></strong><span>个人自我介绍1份（格式不限）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（5）</span></span></strong><span>其他证明材料1份（如已发表论文、各类获奖或资格证书，具有特长、竞赛获奖的学生提供相应证明材料及详细说明）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（6）</span></span></strong><span>系统生成的推免生申报书1份。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/RebxkjTlTcQTgzCN25A2nicuXHCEiaBBq8vTF7LkcXQzROjNEkzaZCCKydSPQ78ljr2aR6UQmADrfmBcu9EeBibGTnXIyt1Og9THXv0iaAywrUk/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><p><span>⭐</span><strong><span><span>注意事项：</span></span></strong><span>在系统中提交的报名材料请按上述顺序扫描整理到一个pdf文档中并压缩后上传，材料力求精简，突出重点，英语水平证明和其他获奖证书建议采用缩印的形式，图文清晰即可。</span><strong><span><span>文件命名：</span></span></strong><span>报名学科方向－姓名－本科学校。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>2.</span></span></strong><span>学院审核学校推免系统报名信息后，给通过审核者发送复试通知，申请人需在规定时间内确认是否接受复试。否则视为放弃。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>3.</span></span></strong><span>复试通过后，学院将发送预接收（拟录取/预录取）通知，申请人于规定时间内确认接收，否则视为放弃。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>4.</span></span></strong><span>学校推免系统报名阶段，凡参加报名的推免生均须参加综合素质测试。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（1）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>测试时间：</span></span></strong><span>9月11日—9月14日；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（2</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>）具体要求：</span></span></strong><span>扫码下载综合素质测试说明及操作指南文档。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2UzEdHTepvDakp4icrKrKb24U46DXibO2ZrCZnJzpgg2JQXSfAZb5N8lzzibiaQnia8xTlRx6sReEWXac8EAGzVtC8LwtPUkb6VfXibbEVJ9RZUnA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>5.</span></span></strong><span><span>所有参加学校推免服务系统报名并被预接收的学生，如获得所在学校推免资格，待全国推免管理服务系统正式开通后，仍须进行正式报名，完成推免生录取流程。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>全国推免管理服务系统报名</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.2</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>1.</span></span></strong><span>已获推免资格的申请人应在规定时间内登录全国推免管理服务系统报名，</span><strong><span><span>网址：</span></span></strong><span>https://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm/。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.提交志愿信息：</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>9月21日9:00</span></span></strong><span>开始，通过系统进行申请，填写志愿信息，上传相关材料。申请人应对所有报名信息</span><strong><span><span>仔细核对，一经提交，将无法更改</span></span></strong><span>。</span><span><span>上传材料包括：</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>（1）</span></span></strong><span>学生证及身份证复印件1份；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（2）</span></span></strong><span>本科阶段成绩单、综合成绩排名证明（均需加盖学校或学院教务部门公章）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（3）</span></span></strong><span>英语水平证明材料1份（英语四/六级考试成绩、TOEFL成绩、GRE/GMAT成绩等）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（4）</span></span></strong><span>个人自我介绍1份（格式不限）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（5）</span></span></strong><span>其他证明材料1份（如已发表论文、各类获奖或资格证书，具有特长、竞赛获奖的学生提供相应证明材料及详细说明）；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>（6）</span></span></strong><span>系统生成的推免生申报书1份。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span>3.发送复试通知：9月22日8:00</span></span></strong><span>开始，学院发送复试通知，申请人于规定时间内完成复试确认，否则视为放弃复试资格。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>4.发送拟录取通知：9月24日8:00</span></span></strong><span>开始，学院发送拟录取通知，申请人</span><strong><span><span>9月24日14:00</span></span></strong><span>开始确认拟录取通知，于规定时间内完成拟录取确认。未按规定时间接受拟录取者，视为放弃拟录取资格。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>5.</span></span></strong><span>我院在学校下达的推免招生计划范围内，对所有申报我院的推免生，</span><strong><span><span>按预接收（拟录取/预录取）、其他推免生的顺序，分批次录取，额满为止</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/ibbDic3EUwGI2y4k27uTicS0ibFsiaDf9fXtd46yLZTjKVxKTPdk7D0C9vysV65ePk9omMw9qZ11HOxQ5NgNeYCLpbw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2UzEdHTepvDumlX9dNBsUO7c8SDl0HekfJHw4Ik9ODX5npUgHPItIAycTKaSqc5R5hQviaiaM6PKV5KiaZ9jOX2wps42qttojpwXXPeJ2icBWmU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>综合考核</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>学校推免服务系统报名阶段已确认预接收（拟录取/预录取）的推免生，不再组织综合考核，直接通过教育部推免服务系统完成报名录取流程。其他未参加学校推免服务系统报名的推免生，正式接收期间亦可申报我院，综合考核安排另行通知。</span></p><p><span>综合考核包括</span><strong><span><span>材料审核、复试、思想政治素质</span></span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span><span>品德考核</span></span></strong><span>。申请人应自觉遵守学校考核（考场）规则及《诚信考核承诺书》等相关要求，考核期间不得对外泄露或传播考核内容等有关信息。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><b><span>材料审核</span></b></font></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.1</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span>由学院组织专家对推免生的申请材料进行严格审核。学院通过报名系统向材料审核通过者发送复试通知，申请人需在规定时间内确认是否接受复试。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/RebxkjTlTcQTgzCN25A2nicuXHCEiaBBq8vTF7LkcXQzROjNEkzaZCCKydSPQ78ljr2aR6UQmADrfmBcu9EeBibGTnXIyt1Og9THXv0iaAywrUk/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><b><span>复试考核</span></b></font></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.2</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1.形式：</span></span></strong><span>复试考核以面试为主，采用线上或线下的形式；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.内容：</span></span></strong><span>包括专业知识考核、综合素质、英语听力和口语测试等；</span></p><p><strong><span><span>3.时间：</span></span></strong><span>以复试通知为准。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/RebxkjTlTcQTgzCN25A2nicuXHCEiaBBq8vTF7LkcXQzROjNEkzaZCCKydSPQ78ljr2aR6UQmADrfmBcu9EeBibGTnXIyt1Og9THXv0iaAywrUk/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><font><b><span>思想政治素质和品德考核  </span></b></font></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>Part.3</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><p><span>思想政治素质和品德考核结果作为录取的</span><strong><span><span>首要依据</span></span></strong><span>，考核不通过者不予录取。普通招考研究生拟录取阶段，学院同时向拟录取的推免生所在学校函调人事档案及本人现实表现等材料，全面考查其思想政治和品德情况。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/enUf10XOwjElFTVf3n2XJSPhPo8YcVYF7RjSOxcNSOibiawv5VatMrV8IQYMQLic70FzBQCoKIAowJtVFqlOiapQmg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/aJHjyhnezbKRNicOse5WiaY9ybBkueAeatWbsiaBFhEfWu4VNm0bDJnaMu465NTnTcfNF68jS7zdpdKm2IaMhIMOg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>拟录取</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>根据综合考核成绩，学院择优确定拟录取名单，经学院招收推免生工作领导小组审议后在学院网站统一公示。</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/ibbDic3EUwGI2y4k27uTicS0ibFsiaDf9fXtd46yLZTjKVxKTPdk7D0C9vysV65ePk9omMw9qZ11HOxQ5NgNeYCLpbw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>专项计划</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>“挑战杯-国创赛”金奖项目</span></span></strong><span>的推免和招生计划由学校按照有关名单统一下达。</span><span><span>优秀营员</span></span><span>按照报考学院要求参加学校推免报名，选择“金奖项目”专项报考，在规定时间内完成学院组织的研究生复试考核，考核通过后，方可列入拟录取名单。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/enUf10XOwjElFTVf3n2XJSPhPo8YcVYF7RjSOxcNSOibiawv5VatMrV8IQYMQLic70FzBQCoKIAowJtVFqlOiapQmg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2UzEdHTepvDumlX9dNBsUO7c8SDl0HekfJHw4Ik9ODX5npUgHPItIAycTKaSqc5R5hQviaiaM6PKV5KiaZ9jOX2wps42qttojpwXXPeJ2icBWmU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>七</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>奖助政策</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>我校硕士研究生奖助金体系包括国家奖学金、国家助学金、学业奖学金、社会奖助金和“三助一辅”岗位津贴以及临时困难补助和绿色通道等。推免的硕士研究生享受硕士奖助金，推免的直博生享受博士奖助金。详情请查阅我校研究生院主页（http://gs.xjtu.edu.cn）相关文件。</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/ibbDic3EUwGI2y4k27uTicS0ibFsiaDf9fXtd46yLZTjKVxKTPdk7D0C9vysV65ePk9omMw9qZ11HOxQ5NgNeYCLpbw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>八</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1.</span></span></strong><span>学术学位全日制研究生一般按硕博贯通模式培养，参见《西安交通大学学术型硕士博士贯通式培养实施办法》（西交研〔2017〕93号）文件。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.</span></span></strong><span>符合免初试资格（具体见当年全国硕士研究生招生工作管理规定）的考生，应在国家规定时间内登录全国推免管理服务系统报名并按学校要求提交相关学术水平证明材料，材料评议审核通过的方可参加复试。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>3.</span></span></strong><span>已获得推荐免试研究生录取资格的申请人，应承诺不再列入当年度就业计划，不再报名参加当年硕士研究生考试招生。录取当年入学时未取得国家承认的本科毕业及学士学位证书的，录取资格无效。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>4.</span></span></strong><span>如发现推免生报考信息弄虚作假、违反招生规定、存在品德失范、学术不端或违法违纪违规等情况的，经相关部门查证属实，学校将按照相关规定取消其申请资格、录取资格或入学资格等，并通报申请人所在学校，产生的一切后果由本人负责。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>5.</span></span></strong><span>已录取的推荐免试直博生，入学前按照学院通知做好博士生网上信息确认、博士报名登记表填写等相关工作。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>6.</span></span></strong><span>录取通知书及入学相关材料与当年普通招考研究生一并发放。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>7.</span></span></strong><span>学校按照《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》（教学〔2003〕3号）规定，结合招生专业实际情况组织体检，在入学时统一安排进行，体检合格准予入学。</span></p><p><strong><span><span>8.</span></span></strong><span>其他未尽事宜由学院招收推免生工作领导小组负责解释。</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/enUf10XOwjElFTVf3n2XJSPhPo8YcVYF7RjSOxcNSOibiawv5VatMrV8IQYMQLic70FzBQCoKIAowJtVFqlOiapQmg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/aJHjyhnezbKRNicOse5WiaY9ybBkueAeatWbsiaBFhEfWu4VNm0bDJnaMu465NTnTcfNF68jS7zdpdKm2IaMhIMOg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>九</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申诉与回避</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span>考生在招生过程中有异议的，可向学院提起申诉，学院将及时受理并予以答复。申诉人对答复有异议的，可向研究生招生办公室提起申诉。考生如在报考学校存在直系亲属或其他利益相关者，应在申请时主动向学院报备。</span></p><p><span><span>学院研究生招生监督邮箱：</span></span><span>wljsxy@xjtu.edu.cn</span></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/ibbDic3EUwGI2y4k27uTicS0ibFsiaDf9fXtd46yLZTjKVxKTPdk7D0C9vysV65ePk9omMw9qZ11HOxQ5NgNeYCLpbw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>十</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>电话：</span></span></strong><span>029-82663942</span></p><p><strong><span><span>联系人：</span></span></strong><span>李老师</span></p><p><strong><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span></strong><span>wxpyb@mail.xjtu.edu.cn</span></p><p><strong><span><span>申诉电话：</span></span></strong><span>029-88963509</span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/enUf10XOwjElFTVf3n2XJSPhPo8YcVYF7RjSOxcNSOibiawv5VatMrV8IQYMQLic70FzBQCoKIAowJtVFqlOiapQmg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/2UzEdHTepvBTcGLDVFRuccaqPWQg74ckG750wBCSSTyiajy1RK2dZggDLA5VJDzTGmzXYaAdzvia3Rxt3J0d48hZiaE6lkOmia3tCxfZN5dh3gk/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>END</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/2UzEdHTepvBTcGLDVFRuccaqPWQg74ckG750wBCSSTyiajy1RK2dZggDLA5VJDzTGmzXYaAdzvia3Rxt3J0d48hZiaE6lkOmia3tCxfZN5dh3gk/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/2UzEdHTepvDr7pRuEACmGjFaGpt3WzsEYNicNrBVmxlgdFgaPq0ZROktMgofHMNaggzJ3qZDqsU3lgGLkRdZka5icCjkJibebHhYb0dJ6bel7w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>扫码关注未来技术学院公众号</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/2UzEdHTepvDfnvvJ87TiafLhb2wv9V7lU0gaEN7obTL4rNuNYFcuFdIGqxZmKGjJPMiaIoZ5l7QiauPvVbljPQ8IcVHe228SVKSKXs8TjhZmYg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"85e7c0322c731bcd39bd1a107d4c0f7348b98232d08a25a82a317245fe9433be","textLength":3215,"sourceSha256":"4f7a093f51c198e0147ebd8a9b6d9122f1ad78a18d50e9eeb3f687106f4c0e5d","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-7412bee8be7b386ba80f","title":"2026年西安交通大学未来技术学院2027年招收推荐免试研究生工作实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:30.665638+00:00"}
